 zip
      " (source) import-path: zip
      " (description) Package zip provides support for reading and writing ZIP archives.
@sep1 Functions in zip
      RegisterCompressor
           " (def) "func RegisterCompressor(method uint16, comp Compressor)"
           " (description) RegisterCompressor registers custom compressors for a specified method ID. The common methods Store and Deflate are built in.
      RegisterDecompressor
           " (def) "func RegisterDecompressor(method uint16, dcomp Decompressor)"
           " (description) RegisterDecompressor allows custom decompressors for a specified method ID. The common methods Store and Deflate are built in.
@sep2 Types in zip
      Compressor
           " (description) other
      Decompressor
           " (description) other
      File
           " (description) struct
           " (description) A File is a single file in a ZIP archive. The file information is in the embedded FileHeader. The file content can be accessed by calling File.Open.
      FileHeader
           " (description) struct
           " (description) FileHeader describes a file within a ZIP file. See the ZIP specification for details.
      ReadCloser
           " (description) struct
           " (description) A ReadCloser is a Reader that must be closed when no longer needed.
      Reader
           " (description) struct
           " (description) A Reader serves content from a ZIP archive.
      Writer
           " (description) struct
           " (description) Writer implements a zip file writer.

 bufio
      " (source) import-path: bufio
      " (description) "Package bufio implements buffered I/O. It wraps an io.Reader or io.Writer object, creating another object (Reader or Writer) that also implements the interface but provides buffering and some help for textual I/O."
