 bytes
      " (source) import-path: bytes
      " (description) Package bytes implements functions for the manipulation of byte slices. It is analogous to the facilities of the strings package.
@sep1 Functions in bytes
      Clone
           " (def) "func Clone(b []byte) []byte"
           " (description) "Clone returns a copy of b[:len(b)]. The result may have additional unused capacity. Clone(nil) returns nil."
      Compare
           " (def) "func Compare(a, b []byte) int"
